# Product Module & Payment Integration - Work Summary

## Page 1

### Objective

Extend the existing Lead Management System by adding a simple Product module with online payment integration to learn product management and payment gateway implementation.

### Completed Work

#### Database

Created two new tables:

* `products`
* `orders`

#### Product APIs

Implemented complete Product CRUD APIs:

* GET `/api/products`
* POST `/api/products`
* GET `/api/products/:id`
* PUT `/api/products/:id`
* DELETE `/api/products/:id`

Features:

* Pagination
* Search
* Category filter
* Active/Inactive filter
* Sorting
* Input validation

#### Order APIs

Implemented:

* GET `/api/orders`
* POST `/api/orders`
* GET `/api/orders/:id`

Features:

* Create pending orders
* Product lookup
* Customer details
* Search & pagination

---

## Page 2

### Razorpay Integration

Configured environment variables:

```text
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET
NEXT_PUBLIC_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID
```

Created a reusable Razorpay helper:

```text
lib/razorpay.ts
```

### Payment APIs

#### Create Order

`POST /api/payment/create-order`

* Fetch product
* Create Razorpay order
* Save pending order
* Return payment details

#### Verify Payment

`POST /api/payment/verify`

* Verify payment signature
* Update payment status
* Save payment information
* Mark order as Success or Failed

### Current Status

Completed:

* Products database
* Orders database
* Product CRUD APIs
* Order APIs
* Razorpay configuration
* Payment APIs (Create Order & Verify Payment)

Pending:

* Products UI
* Product Details page
* Checkout page
* Razorpay frontend integration
* Payment Success/Failed pages
* Orders Dashboard
* End-to-end payment testing
